flowchart TB
    Browser["Traveller’s browser<br/>raileurope.com"]
    subgraph RE["Rail Europe infrastructure"]
        Router["raileurope.com<br/>Routing layer"]
        Website["Existing Rail Europe website<br/>Landing page, blog, other content"]
        Proxy["Reverse proxy<br/>Upstream: raileurope.wl.omio.com"]
    end
    subgraph Omio["Omio infrastructure"]
        CF["Cloudflare<br/>Trust approved proxy IPs or secret header"]
        WL["Rail Europe whitelabel<br/>raileurope.wl.omio.com"]
        Links["Search entry<br/>/links/{linkId}"]
        App["Booking application<br/>/app/*"]
        Dependencies["Supporting APIs and assets<br/>Including /wl-* and /gcs-proxy/*"]
    end
    Browser -->|HTTPS requests| Router
    Router -->|Existing content routes| Website
    Router -->|"/links/*, /app/* and agreed dependencies"| Proxy
    Proxy -->|"HTTPS · preserve path and query<br/>Upstream Host/SNI<br/>Agreed proxy authentication"| CF
    CF --> WL
    WL --> Links
    WL --> App
    WL --> Dependencies
    Proxy -->|"Rewrite upstream redirects and URLs<br/>Adapt cookie domains<br/>Return response under raileurope.com"| Browser
    classDef default fill:#071d38,stroke:#385675,color:#a5c9ff,rx:16,ry:16;
    style RE fill:#19232f,stroke:#354456,color:#e3e8ef
    style Omio fill:#19232f,stroke:#354456,color:#e3e8ef
